{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14236","headline":"故秘监丹阳郡公延陵包公挽歌词 · 窦常","name":"故秘监丹阳郡公延陵包公挽歌词","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"卓绝明时第，孤贞贵後贫。\n郄诜爲胄子，季札是乡人。\n笔下调金石，花开领搢绅。\n那堪归葬日，哭渡柳杨津。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"窦常","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14236.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14236","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}